<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Loadout">Starting Loadout</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Silent?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Starting Loadout" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Silent?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Loadout"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Relic">Starting Relic</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Silent?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Starting Relic" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Silent?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Relic"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<p><span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ring of the Snake" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake" title="Ring of the Snake"><img alt="RingoftheSnake.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/24px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/36px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 1.5x, /images/thumb/RingoftheSnake.png/48px-RingoftheSnake.png?428c38 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Snake" title="Ring of the Snake">Ring of the Snake</a></span> - At the start of each combat, draw 2 additional cards.
Can be replaced by <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Ring of the Serpent" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Serpent" title="Ring of the Serpent"><img alt="RingoftheSerpent.png" src="/images/thumb/RingoftheSerpent.png/24px-RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RingoftheSerpent.png/36px-RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2 1.5x, /images/thumb/RingoftheSerpent.png/48px-RingoftheSerpent.png?9110b2 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ring_of_the_Serpent" title="Ring of the Serpent">Ring of the Serpent</a></span>.
</p>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Starting_Deck">Starting Deck</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Silent?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Starting Deck" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Silent?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Starting Deck"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<ul><li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strike (Silent)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strike_(Silent)" title="Strike (Silent)"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strike_(Silent)" title="Strike (Silent)">Strike</a></span> x5</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Defend (Silent)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Defend_(Silent)" title="Defend (Silent)"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Defend_(Silent)" title="Defend (Silent)">Defend</a></span> x5</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Survivor" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Survivor" title="Survivor"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Survivor" title="Survivor">Survivor</a></span> x1</li>
<li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Neutralize" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Neutralize" title="Neutralize"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Neutralize" title="Neutralize">Neutralize</a></span> x1</li></ul>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Silent_Cards">Silent Cards</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Silent?veaction=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Silent Cards" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Silent?action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Silent Cards"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h3>
<p>There are a total of 71 regular cards in the Silent's card pool.
</p>
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Green&amp;rarity=Common"><span>Common Cards</span></a></span> x19</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Uncommon.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Uncommon.png?eaedc0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Uncommon.png?eaedc0 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Green&amp;rarity=Uncommon"><span>Uncommon Cards</span></a></span> x33</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/File:CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png" class="image"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Green&amp;rarity=Rare"><span>Rare Cards</span></a></span> x19</li></ul>
<p>A full list of Silent Cards can be found <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?color=Green"><span>here</span></a></span>.
</p>
