<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Unlocks">Unlocks</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Silent?veaction=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Unlocks" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Silent?action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Unlocks"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>The Silent is unlocked by completing (does not have to be a win) a run with the <a href="/wiki/Ironclad" title="Ironclad">Ironclad</a>.
</p>
