</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Lore">Lore</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Silent?veaction=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Lore" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Silent?action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Lore"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p>When completing the Act 3 event <span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Sensory Stone" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Sensory_Stone" title="Sensory Stone"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Sensory_Stone" title="Sensory Stone">Sensory Stone</a></span>, you 'recall' what appear to be memories regarding the pasts of the characters. The <span class="ts-green">TRIUMPH</span> dialogue may recall a battle between the Silent and the <a href="/wiki/Nemesis" title="Nemesis">Nemesis</a>, and her reason for climbing the Spire.
</p>
<blockquote><div style="font-style:italic"><span class="ts-green ts-up"><span style="--i:0">TRIUMPH</span></span><br />
<p>The remains of a <span class="ts-purple ts-up"><span style="--i:0">ghostly</span> <span style="--i:1">creature</span></span> sink slowly into the mud before you, barely visible in the moonlight. You have proven yourself amongst your sisters.<br />
</p><p>Standing victoriously, you wait in silence as the others ceremoniously place the <span class="ts-gold">creature's skull</span> atop your head. The ritual has concluded.<br />
</p>
You head towards the Spire...</div></blockquote>
